# Chronica donor reference repos — re-fetch manifest for cloud sessions.
#
# WHY THIS EXISTS: Temporary/ (the 81 donor reference repos) is gitignored and multi-GB, and GitHub
# rejects files >100MB — so the donors are NOT in the repo. Pushing them from a laptop is slow (the
# wait we are avoiding). Instead, a cloud session runs tools/repo/clone-donors.sh which clones each donor
# from its public source at CLOUD bandwidth (minutes). The donors are public OSS reference material.
#
# FORMAT:  <Temporary-dir-name>  <git-url-or-UNRESOLVED>   [# note]
# RESOLVED rows clone automatically. UNRESOLVED rows are skipped — fill the URL (or drop the donor).
# The 18 marked (git) were read from the donor's own origin remote = exact source.

